@base = http://localhost:8000

### C-05: Intento 1 fallido
# esperado: 401 {"detail":"Credenciales inválidas"}
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vendedor@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordIncorrecta1!"
}

